md:15:  시트는 `npm run rulepack:review-sheet`(내부 명령: `npx tsx scripts/rulepack/review-sheet.ts`)로 재생성한다. 사람의 검토 순서는 ① `表5.3.2`·`表5.3.4`의 L1/L1h, ② `表5.3.6`의 柱＝大梁 조건, ③ 단발항과 결번(欠番)이다. 각 단위의 원문 PDF를 대조해 **전 칸 일치**라고 회신한 뒤에만 그 단위가 덮는 행의 `confidence`를 `stated`로 올리고 `note`의 「独立検討待ち」를 지운다. `src/rulepack/index.test.ts`의 「`stated`는 0행」 고정도 같은 커밋에서 함께 고친다. 셋 중 하나라도 다른 커밋이면 승격하지 않는다. 사람의 회신 전에는 `stated` 0행을 유지하며, 따라서 R6은 여전히 열려 있다.\\\\n5:- **M2 보강 (2026-08-27, phase 30 step 2)**: 룰팩 243행(`transcribed` 240행, `inferred` 3행)을 8개 표＋17개 단발항＝25개 대조 단위·135칸으로 확인한다. 생성은 `npm run rulepack:review-sheet`; 검토는 ①表5.3.2·5.3.4 L1/L1h ②表5.3.6 柱＝大梁 ③단발항·결번 순이다. 사람이 단위별 전 칸 일치를 회신한 뒤 해당 행의 `confidence`를 `stated`로 올리고 `note`의 「独立検討待ち」를 지우며, `src/rulepack/index.test.ts`의 「`stated`는 0행」 고정을 같은 커밋에서 함께 고친다. 그 전까지 `stated` 0행이며 M2와 R6은 각각 진행 중·열림이다.\\\\n789:**2026-08-27 정정 (phase 30 step 1 결과)**: 실제 생성된 시트는 룰팩 243행\\\\n\\\",\\\"exit_code\\\":0,\\\"status\\\":\\\"completed\\\"}}\\nphases/30-rulepack-review-sheet\\\\step2-codex.stdout.log-59-{\\\"type\\\":\\\"item.completed\\\",\\\"item\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"item_29\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"command_execution\\\",\\\"command\\\":\\\"\\\\\\\"C:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\WINDOWS\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\System32\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\WindowsPowerShell\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\v1.0\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\powershell.exe\\\\\\\" -Command 'Get-Date -Format o'\\\",\\\"aggregated_output\\\":\\\"2026-08-27T15:36:47.8830472+09:00\\\\r\\\\n\\\",\\\"exit_code\\\":0,\\\"status\\\":\\\"completed\\\"}}\\nphases/30-rulepack-review-sheet\\\\step2-codex.stdout.log-60-{\\\"type\\\":\\\"item.completed\\\",\\\"item\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"item_30\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"command_execution\\\",\\\"command\\\":\\\"\\\\\\\"C:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\WINDOWS\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\System32\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\WindowsPowerShell\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\v1.0\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\powershell.exe\\\\\\\" -Command '$a=(Get-Content -Encoding UTF8 AGENTS.md | Where-Object { $_ -like '\\\\\\\"'| R6 |*' }); \\\\\\\"'$b=(Get-Content -Encoding UTF8 CLAUDE.md | Where-Object { $_ -like '