칸으로 확인한다. 생성은 `npm run rulepack:review-sheet`; 검토는 ①表5.3.2·5.3.4 L1/L1h ②表5.3.6 柱＝大梁 ③단발항·결번 순이다. 사람이 단위별 전 칸 일치를 회신한 뒤 해당 행의 `confidence`를 `stated`로 올리고 `note`의 「独立検討待ち」를 지우며, `src/rulepack/index.test.ts`의 「`stated`는 0행」 고정을 같은 커밋에서 함께 고친다. 그 전까지 `stated` 0행이며 M2와 R6은 각각 진행 중·열림이다.\\\\\\\\n789:**2026-08-27 정정 (phase 30 step 1 결과)**: 실제 생성된 시트는 룰팩 243행\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"exit_code\\\\\\\":0,\\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"completed\\\\\\\"}}\\\\r\\\\n+{\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"item.completed\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"item\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"item_29\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"command_execution\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"command\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"C:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\WINDOWS\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\System32\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\WindowsPowerShell\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\v1.0\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\powershell.exe\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" -Command 'Get-Date -Format o'\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"aggregated_output\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"2026-08-27T15:36:47.8830472+09:00\\\\\\\\r\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"exit_code\\\\\\\":0,\\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"completed\\\\\\\"}}\\\\r\\\\n+{\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"item.completed\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"item\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"item_30\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"command_execution\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"command\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"C:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\WINDOWS\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\System32\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\WindowsPowerShell\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\v1.0\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\powershell.exe\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" -Command '$a=(Get-Content -Encoding UTF8 AGENTS.md | Where-Object { $_ -like '\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"'| R6 |*' }); \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"'$b=(Get-Content -Encoding UTF8 CLAUDE.md | Where-Object { $_ -like '\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"'| R6 |*' }); if (\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"'$a -ceq $b) { '\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"'R6-sync: identical' } else { 'R6-sync: mismatch' }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"aggregated_output\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"R6-sync: identica